"                            locateur doit vous en remettre une copie dans les dix\n"
"                            jours de la signature (art. 1895 C.c.Q.)."
msgstr ""
"The form has not been filed. Within 10 days after entering into\n"
"                            the lease, the lessor is bound to give you a copy\n"
"                            (art. 1895 CCQ)."

#. module: bf_rental_portal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_rental_portal.portal_rental_leases
